@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+// ports/ratelimit.ts — THE RATE-LIMITER PORT. tooling/ports/ratelimit.json is its
+// registry; tooling/ports/README.md is the standard.
+//
+// ⏱ 2026-10-01 · O-CLOUDFLARE-BINDINGS-SCATTERED (port-storage). The ~18
